Package: fastumi-tools
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FastUMI Team <yding25@binghamton.edu>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), systemd, udev, xdg-utils, dfu-util, python3-opencv, python3-numpy
Recommends: fastumi-tools-resources (>= @CATALOG_VERSION@), v4l-utils, g++, gnome-terminal
Suggests: rviz
Homepage: https://github.com/KM-Data-Pipeline/FastUMI_Tools
Description: Unified FastUMI device management console
 FastUMI Tools for Ubuntu 20.04 provides a local web console for XVSDK and firmware
 management, USB and version diagnostics, ROS topic monitoring, RViz,
 camera preview and calibration utilities.
